Beginner -> CareerPath: choose goal
CareerPath -> Technology: follow roadmap
Technology -> Course: open track
Course -> Module: study in order
Module -> Tutorial: learn
Tutorial -> Lab: practise
Lab -> Project: build
Project -> Capstone: prove skills
Capstone -> Interview: prepare
Interview -> Certification: optional exams
Certification -> JobReady: apply skills
